#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:861
#, no-c-format
msgid "Articles"
msgstr "Articles"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:862
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For every gender you enter here the definite and the indefinite article. If "
"there is none for this language, you leave the field empty."
