#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:869
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the similar manner you input the descriptor for the first, second and "
"third person each in plural and singular."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:871
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because many languages do not distinguish in the third person plural, there "
"is a check box to determine this."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:873
#, no-c-format
msgid "Leave the unneccessary fields empty."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
