#: index.docbook:1299
#, no-c-format
msgid "Query count"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1300
#, no-c-format
msgid "Choose how often the selection must be queried."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1305
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bad count"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1306
#, no-c-format
msgid "The same for the amount of times the entry was not known."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1311
#, no-c-format
msgid "Last query"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1312
#, no-c-format
msgid "Include queries before or within the given time span."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Entries which have not been queried yet are always included if you choose "
"<emphasis>before</emphasis>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1319
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Entries are only included if all conditions are fulfilled. If you want a "
"property to be ignored, choose <guilabel>Do not care </guilabel>for it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1325
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blocking"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1328
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Blocking Settings</guilabel> dialog screenshot"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1331
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Blocking Settings</guilabel> dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1335
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On this page you select the time, an known entry is excluded from queries "
"resp. when it must be queried at the latest."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1338
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two conditions which must be fulfilled, otherwise you will be "
"shown an according warning:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1342
#, no-c-format
msgid "The time must increase from level to level"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1344
#, no-c-format
msgid "The time for blocking must be less than for expiring in the same level."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1348
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If at least one of blocking or expiring is active, the thresholds from "
"<guilabel>Grade</guilabel>, <guilabel>Query count</guilabel>, <guilabel>Bad "
"count</guilabel> and <guilabel>Last query</guilabel> on the previous dialog "
"page are not taken into account."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1358
#, no-c-format
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "Perfils"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Profile is a set of settings (settings related to queries) which you can "
"save/load in order to use again later. This <guibutton>Profiles...</"
"guibutton> button at the bottom of the <guilabel>Configure &parley;</"
"guilabel> dialog allows you to see existing profiles, to load a new profile "
"and to save your current settings in a new profile."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1364
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Clicking on the <guibutton>Profiles...</guibutton> button will display the "
"following dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1366
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo><guilabel>Profiles</guilabel> dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1369
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase><guilabel>Profiles</guilabel> dialog</phrase>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1375
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Enregistrar"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1376
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves the current query settings under the current name."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1382
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Carga"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1383
#, no-c-format
msgid "Load the settings from the profile in the listbox."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1388
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>New</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1389
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creates a new profile with the current settings."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1394
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Delete</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1395
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes the current profile."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1399
#, no-c-format
