#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1518
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Synonyms</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1519
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you may enter words that have the same meaning as the expression. There "
"is also a query type for this expression."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1525
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Antonyms</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1526
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is for words that have the opposite meaning. This field can also be "
"queried."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1531
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Example</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1532
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally you may enter here an example sentence for the expression. "
"There is a simple query type which prompts you with the content of this "
"field but with dots instead of the word in question."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1540
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is an optional field to store additional information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1545
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Paraphrase</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1546
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you may enter a description in different words. There is also a query "
"type for this expression."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:1554
#, no-c-format
msgid "Suggestions For Multiple Choice Query"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1557
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multiple choice dialog screenshot"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:1560
#, no-c-format
msgid "Multiple choice dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1564
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to create an efficient multiple choice query it is good to offer "
"expressions that are similar to the solution to make it more difficult. If "
"you do not offer them, &parley; has only the possibility to create such "
"queries with randomly chosen expressions which are rather easy to guess. You "
"can enter up to five expressions for this purpose."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1575
#, no-c-format
msgid "Additional properties for verbs"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1577
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can edit the entries on the <guilabel>Conjugation</guilabel> page only "
"when you selected <guilabel>verb</guilabel> as word type."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:1581
#, no-c-format
