msgid "Comparison entry dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1614
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you enter the the comparison forms of the adjective."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:1620
#, no-c-format
msgid "Properties from or to the original"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:1622
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For some properties it is possible to set up values <emphasis>from</"
"emphasis> the original or <emphasis>to</emphasis> the original. For example "
"you can have a grade when querying the translation (=> from the original). "
"The opposite is the grade when querying the original when one of the "
